# Chromium's profile for the Whatnot scraper: runtime state, rebuilt on demand,
# and holding a live session. Default/Cookies plus Local State together are
# enough to recover the signed-in session, so this must never be committed —
# 142 of these files were, once, by an over-broad `git add -A`.
/storage/whatnot-browser-profile/
/storage/whatnot-browser-profile.broken/

# The saved session itself, in every shape it takes.
#
# Listed as a pattern rather than one line per file because the per-file list
# had already drifted: whatnot-cookies.json.loaded-mtime was ignored and
# whatnot-live-cookies.json.loaded-mtime was not, so a `git stash -u` on the
# production box swept the live session's marker away while leaving its
# sibling alone. Untracked and ignored are not the same thing — only the
# second survives a stash or a reset.
/storage/whatnot-*.json
/storage/whatnot-*.json.loaded-mtime

# Desktop collector configuration contains the VortexOps API bearer token.
/desktop-collector/config.json
